stry this starcycle.","line2":"The planet shows signs of valuable mineral deposits and may attract significant freight interest soon.","pageNum":11}},{"sd":831,"layout":1,"issueNum":2,"paperName":"The Nebula Times","paperSlogan":"Your universe, delivered daily","major":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Established at Omnithos — Jaemin Takes the Helm","body1":"Omnivore Logistics has formally entered the galactic freight business, establishing its base of operations at Omnithos. Jaemin, the corporation's newly appointed director, confirmed the launch of its first train, the Omnivore No.1, which departed Omnithos this starcycle.","body2":"\"We are here to compete,\" Jaemin said in a brief public statement. The arrival of Omnivore Logistics draws immediate comparisons to Pulsar Bound, which also launched recently. Whether there is room in the galaxy for both corporations remains an open question.","pageNum":1,"imgType":"ceo_jaemin","_pln":{"id":736,"starId":205,"orbitRadius":2223.0001912344715,"orbitAngle":50.686864053082694,"orbitSpeed":0.00014997375043783982,"x":-121748.44744415293,"y":-47787.90332612738,"size":"M","radius":96,"type":{"id":"resort","base":"#0e58b8","hi":"#38aaf0","rim":[65,175,255],"_b":{"id":"resort","lms":[{"cx":0.828679947698925,"cy":-0.1110428789034679,"rx":0.4990937072489412,"ry":0.2841605660863199,"rot":2.4172124580004084,"isLarge":true,"pts":[{"x":-0.30664650718199565,"y":0.15448565565263528},{"x":-0.5818725339581386,"y":0.09368120771202589},{"x":-0.5527107610998672,"y":-0.05506126223787612},{"x":-0.30720214535406115,"y":-0.12540059587433072},{"x":-0.26336624968808436,"y":-0.27449128224404895},{"x":-0.028547842272074915,"y":-0.317292824174908},{"x":0.1403481054481882,"y":-0.19026203171340486},{"x":0.43080724882858157,"y":-0.21703668144405672},{"x":0.5607547485990084,"y":-0.09028125407752599},{"x":0.3321146127800695,"y":0.03308538764637864},{"x":0.3980972640969723,"y":0.16250418458557542},{"x":0.2800257910223949,"y":0.29185455057424875},{"x":0.025